LiteParse (LlamaIndex)

The scalar raster operations, line-kernel detection geometry, grayscale line
batching and script routing are adapted from LiteParse's ocria-nano runtime,
and the LayoutNet features, decoding and grid-projection signals from its
table model and page projection:

  https://github.com/run-llama/liteparse (crates/liteparse/src/ocr/ocria,
  crates/liteparse/src/table_model and crates/liteparse/src/projection.rs,
  v2.21.2)
